OL,3,GNEWSACarla Lockhart resigns as DUP
OL,4,Aparty officer over strategy 'concerns'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCarla Lockhart has stood down as party
OL,7,Fofficer for the Democratic Unionist
OL,8,FParty (DUP) as a difference of opinion
OL,9,Fover how to deal with the fallout of
OL,10,Fthe Drumcree dispute persists within
OL,11,Fthe party.
OL,13,FAn an officer she belonged to a small,
OL,14,Fdecision-making committee within the
OL,15,FDUP.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
