OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACarla Lockhart resigns as DUP
OL,4,Aparty officer over strategy 'concerns'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I believe in standing true to my
OL,7,Fprinciples. I cannot continue to be
OL,8,Fpart of the team that decide on the
OL,9,Fdirection and strategy discussions of
OL,10,Fthe party, whilst clearly having
OL,11,Fconcerns about that," she said in a
OL,12,Fstatement.
OL,14,FDUP leader Gavin Robinson said "she
OL,15,Fremains a key part of our team" and
OL,16,Fthat he "would rather than she hadn't
OL,17,Fof" quit her party officer role.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
